{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-agent-conductor#card-zh","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-agent-conductor","commit":"aed587c157a67b0955c3107670cd74d009c86d8a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-conductor 是面向 DSH 的跨 agent 派活工具，可作为技能脚本、host bundle 工具或动态插件使用。它把自包含任务交给 Codex、Claude Code、TraeCode、OpenCode、Gemini、Cursor、Kimi、Qwen、Copilot、WorkBuddy 或 Grok CLI，并将标准输出带回会话。用户可先用 dry-run 检查目标、工作目录和参数，也可用 doctor 查看命令是否可用；执行支持超时与结果截断。适合需要独立研究、代码分析或实现的 DSH 用户；需安装并登录目标 CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-27","index.js:68-89","skills/conductor/scripts/dispatch.py:100-124"]}
